<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka National 6-mth net up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka National 6-mth net up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			   1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	387.77   vs	321.14</p>
<p>    Turnover	1,717.20   vs    1,380.18</p>
<p>    Tax		 162.80   vs	116.14</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. National Development Bank Ltd is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>The bank said last week it will convert and float on the Colombo bourse 27.5 million 10-rupee convertible debentures, now held by the government. Under the terms of an early conversion agreement, the debentures will be converted into 18.33 million shares, the bank said.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
